{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>TVB小花游嘉欣（游游）近期憑熱播新劇《夫妻的博弈》中飾演馬國明的「豪門兄妹」而備受關注。不過，近日網上流傳出她不同階段的照片對比，質疑她「外貌進化」。面對「變臉」疑雲，游嘉欣不但沒有選擇迴避，除了大方在該帖文下方留言外，日前更特意拍片親自作出澄清！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"80d63b80-de6a-4643-8edd-4a0bef9f9a34.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20265OtVmQckhf1787108046.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"80d63b80-de6a-4643-8edd-4a0bef9f9a34.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e61db313ba951a19-540\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>游嘉欣以「不瞞大家了」為題發文，笑言：「歷時八年嘅『整容』史今日終於要曝光啦（其實係八年嘅努力史🥹！）」原來由19歲到26歲，她全靠勤力健身，慢慢練就出如今的馬甲線及結實腹肌。單單是令網民羨慕的直角肩，她就花費了整整8年時間去「打磨」。她更幽默直言：「大家冇講錯，我個樣確實每一年都在進化緊」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e61db313ba951a19-540\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9d61ee60-3a56-4c7d-8662-8b266e68be5d.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026tAKUPlAGl01787108046.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9d61ee60-3a56-4c7d-8662-8b266e68be5d.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_e61db313ba951a19-541\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>針對網民質疑她曾進行削骨、整鼻以及微笑唇等醫美或整容手術，游嘉欣在片中逐一親自破解！她更即場在鏡頭前做出經典的「豬鼻」動作，力證自己絕無「加工」：「喺我出世嘅時候已經整好」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_e61db313ba951a19-541\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_e61db313ba951a19-541\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1a5a4c72-69cb-464c-b0b8-2698e5420a12.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026qxgquSLVHI1787108045.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1a5a4c72-69cb-464c-b0b8-2698e5420a12.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_e61db313ba951a19-542\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>影片尾聲，游游更預告下一條影片將會公開自己的「整容級化妝術」，隨即引來大批網民紛紛敲碗期待：「期待下一集化妝術」、「想睇你分享健身同健康減肥」。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T15:40:56.347358+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":434,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}